Steve Leferve wrote:
> What are the most valuable rings? Is there a difference between rings you
> value in the early game and rings you value in the late game?

I've come up with the following quite subjective classification...
(G: good, H: helpful, N: nice; for S: start, M: midgame, E: end)

   G  S      invisibility
   G  S      poison resistance
   G  S M    searching
   G  S M    warning
   G    M E  free action (good for endgame)
   G    M E  levitation (quite necessary for endgame)
   G  S M E  regeneration (good for start, otherwise helpful)

   H  S M E  conflict
   H  S M    protection from shape changers
   H  S M    see invisible

   N  S      adornment
   N  S M    slow digestion
   N    M    stealth
   N    M E  teleport control
   N  S M E  increase damage
   N  S M E  polymorph control

Needless to say that even I, myself, am not sure whether that is
accurate enough, as I switched entries from one class to another
depending on the game situation that comes to my mind.  But as a
rough outline it seems o.k. for me, now.  Take it as such.

